  "htmlContent": "<p>因為雲端虛擬機不會包含本機的 <code>.env</code> 檔案，所以必須將金鑰存放在 GitHub 儲存庫的 <strong>Secrets</strong> 裡面供腳本讀取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/notion/4113eb21-f1cc-80d4-97e4-ef3788bdfa16-1.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>\n<p>需要以下兩個金鑰，點上圖綠色新增即可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_API_KEY</strong></code></li>\n<li><code><strong>NOTION_DATABASE_ID</strong></code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/31682f85-b904-4805-902e-18126780c624/3a3210e3-1b45-4e6f-9c69-03f97fe5894c/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4667J72JRHY%2F20261127%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20261127T015936Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEP7%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIB8EuyhVms6%2BlIZRTk1mPOszW%2B%2FrLXtz5lyZnB5UMch%2FAiAGM0zTzoUHvGhYc5NoMSqmD18tspa%2FOVrtOnHMRghgDSqIBAjH%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F8BEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIM%2BGGGoKMAcnAUB05SKtwDn5udB3r43IvYJEjsPFUASafgmLL%2BFy9XvgcZtB7vOh5fW%2BV3hXpSwnxeMivRZQS%2BIBIbmxoM%2BVxkFx%2F%2BRIHqyI3lSE%2FNOdTpVJYStsgEGm7ZdA2YCrueXLsO%2B%2BeS%2BGcIpTBZsoHa3gOs7NgtwHhO3BYnlcE1r%2BqdBnSL9njLG9xVPkECmGfBymjUcOqJyuwAwB6Vy38XGFjT4lMwJGx%2F6B%2Bj1vKNH3F8s9dXtuGy6LpQPimbSgn7nKERMJuw1NyCqDKFOqY0JMj2Uv3gH6TJT7vSHsha8ZyyNu7sLPYFxdx%2F73CVRIbhUNdXes7iTZ2wWodQXu95auO%2Bceap9GzcV2K6aLy1f79yt%2BovuU%2FZZpl09uJ3RIhrMFOUq6y%2FKA4mrvKlLcl%2FPmy89KVU4TWu7pXkRJ0SWdTOMT4fRrkJLD9Zf7zCkt9bwOBCXI70XtdT74sXVV301LKgMVOgO%2B2Ma%2BebXIFVVQRYXpfRlOOgBiOV6EsALnVkEJjhxE17xiQeh3oIZDM7RTmWKsxMkWsuL0yHFTjFBa1wnVSl8PrVDSM1r8WMa%2Fc2%2F7RyJbt2xq7j0SdFK6hTtrXCXstMhbR99t3UDvl2Phx4DqcuwmMknbOJjmk6uRgmHwDnt8Mw79Gi2AY6pgH3jSz1f%2F%2B5N0Sy8265n5HTTzsbWnz3JRdjtrTJTQwjHax%2B%2BuzgTs1RHqK5apwUUJITmv17FyLAQzvLuPUfDNFEzAQbuU%2BglIAGCynR8eVIBERm4UIEV2PsT66fA1xnE1I1ivfj3OIAYybTirdaMZxYED9eoA2XxTHnhkJx6h3aeR9dYR87MVsM80uy2l2fzZy3nxB9zZjmWdLOnT45NFlQTqOCpa0h&amp;X-Amz-Signature=e812b5fb01ea638aa75e632fcef78069172e